== (a) how the boundary markers resolve ==
[MODULE CONTENT: PAGE 1]	-> tag=page	directive=PAGE_BOUNDARY	class=tag
[MODULE CONTENT: PAGE 2]	-> tag=page	directive=PAGE_BOUNDARY	class=tag
[END OF PAGE]	-> tag=end page	directive=PAGE_BOUNDARY	class=tag
[END PAGE]	-> tag=end page	directive=PAGE_BOUNDARY	class=tag
[LESSON 1 CONTENT]	-> tag=lesson content	directive=SECTION_MARKER	class=tag
[LESSON 2 CONTENT]	-> tag=lesson content	directive=SECTION_MARKER	class=tag
[END OF DROPDOWN MENU]	-> tag=end dropdown	directive=CONTAINER_CLOSE	class=tag
[END OF DROP DOWN MENU]	-> tag=end dropdown	directive=CONTAINER_CLOSE	class=tag
[Content for DROP DOWN MENU]	-> tag=dropdown	directive=INTERACTIVE	class=tag
[END OF MODULE]	-> tag=end other	directive=CONTAINER_CLOSE	class=tag
[TITLE BAR]	-> tag=title bar	directive=SECTION_MARKER	class=tag
[Fundamental content]	-> tag=lesson content	directive=SECTION_MARKER	class=tag
[Fundamental 1 code]	-> tag=lesson content	directive=SECTION_MARKER	class=tag

